# EAS Build (the Koko phone app, in app/) uploads this repository from its root. The app needs only app/ and
# packages/shared, so everything else stays out, above all the site's audio/ and media/ (about 120 MB): the app
# downloads lessons, sounds and videos from the site while it runs.
# While this file exists, EAS does not read .gitignore, so the .gitignore rules are repeated below.
#
# No pattern here may end in "/": eas-cli checks folders as "app", not "app/", so a folder-only pattern such as
# "!/app/" never matches and "/*" would drop the whole app (the first build uploaded an empty archive).
# Check with: eas build:inspect -p android --stage archive -o /tmp/eas-archive (from app/).
/*
!/app
!/packages
/packages/*
!/packages/shared

# from .gitignore and app/.gitignore
*.tmp
node_modules
app/.expo
app/dist
app/web-build
app/expo-env.d.ts
app/ios
app/android
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.env*.local

# not needed to build the app
app/store
app/scripts
